[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_22]
The Nirik Rebellion

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_22_desc]
Due to unknown reasons, the country of Kirin has erupted into a violent conflict, with a group of Nirik residents launching a rebellion against the dominant Kirin government.
There is not much known about the country of Kirin, and the mainstream speculation is that the cause of the civil war is the long-standing conflict between the Kirins and Niriks. However, some scholars who have visited the country of Kirin have claimed that there is no difference in the physiological species between the Kirins and Niriks, and that the conflict between them is more likely due to other reasons such as politics, economics, or religion.
The country of Kirin is located on the Kirinthal continent, to the southeast of the Equestria continent. The main living species in the country are the Kirins and Niriks. Historically, the Kirins and Niriks have had conflicts many times, but in recent years, the relationship has been somewhat relaxed. The country of Kirin has not communicated with the outside world for a long time, until the war on the Equestria continent broke out. Since then, the country of Kirin has gradually opened up, but the outside world still knows very little about it. Now, the leaders and political scholars of Equestria are closely watching the situation of the Kirin civil war, and trying to infer the cause of the civil war, as well as the impact of the civil war on the Equestria continent.
However, so far, no country has clearly stated that it will intervene in the civil war, support one side, or mediate the conflict between the two sides.

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_22_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_22_THREAT]
The Nirik Rebellion

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_23]
Tirek Assassinated!

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_23_desc]
Breaking news! Lord Tirek has been assassinated while on a tour of his realm and is now confirmed dead!

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_23_o0]
Okay... wait, what?

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_24]
Anugypt Conflict

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_24_desc]
At the desert in the southwest of Equestria, a conflict is quietly escalating.
Since Anugypt entered the city-state era, under the framework of the Anugypt League Conference, the relationship between the city-states is relatively harmonious. Though there are occasional frictions between the Jackals, Pegasi and Cats, they are generally restrained.
In recent years, with the the wealth of Anugypt region being targeted by first Las Pegasus then the Free Equestria, a large number of goods and orders have poured into Anugypt, causing the contradictions between the city-states to gradually intensify.
The direct trigger of the Anugypt Conflict is that recently, the Jackals, with the support of Las Pegasus Group, have begun to purchase military equipment more frequently and cut off the trade routes of other city-states. The descendants of Cleopatrot, the neighboring city-states, were the first to express dissatisfaction with this and demanded condemnation at the Anugypt League Conference.
As the Jackals refused to accept the results of the meeting and withdrew from the Anugypt League Conference, the Cleopatrot descendants, who had always had independent intentions, also withdrew from the Anugypt League Conference, condemning the Jackals’ aggressive behavior and the inaction of the Anugypt League Conference. The framework of the Anugypt League Conference gradually collapsed.
Sensing the danger of war, the Cats living in the Anugypt region formed a separate alliance and declared neutrality, while the remaining city-states in the League Conference joined the suppression of the Jackals and the descendants of Cleopatrot.

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_24_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_24_THREAT]
Anugypt Conflict

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_25]
Ponyville Summer Music Festival

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_25_desc]
The upcoming Ponyville Summer Music Festival promises to be a harmonious blend of classical elegance and modern beats!
Leading the orchestral front is Ms. Octavia, the esteemed cellist and also a sponsor of the renowned Octavia Orchestra. With her refined musical skills and sophisticated demeanor, Ms. Octavia is sure to captivate audiences with the orchestra’s melodic performances.
On the electronic music side, DJ Pon-3 takes the stage with her cutting-edge beats and innovative soundscapes. Known for her vibrant energy and unique style, DJ Pon-3 is set to bring a modern twist to the festival, infusing it with electronic magic that will resonate with fans of all ages.
Together, Octavia and DJ Pon-3 are set to create a musical experience like no other, inviting music lovers from across Equestria to come together in the spirit of “Peace and Harmony” and enjoy a joyous time.

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_25_o0]
Sounds good

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_25_o1]
Eww! Gross!

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_25_THREAT]
Ponyville Summer Music Festival

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_26]
The Bright Side of the Centaurs

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_26_desc]
Speaking of Tirek’s Realm, ponies always have their first impression of a distant, closed, and evil country on the barren Infernal Lands. Previously, most centaurs were kind and gentle. But now, the noble centaurs own everything there, and they are always coveting the magic of ponies and the treasures of dragons and griffons. If they could still be called restrained during the Vorak era, Tirek’s reign has completely loosened the reins that bound them. Now, despite the wealth that flows continuously from the griffon kingdom and the dragons to them, the vast majority of centaurs have hardly ever left their country except for a few ostentatious nobles. Nopony knows what is happening in the deep of the Infernal Lands — until today.
Rarely, Tirek and Scorpan appeared before the press at the same time, announcing two important events: a Great Exhibition and an International Film Festival. According to Tirek, Scorpan proposed these two events to him as an opportunity to showcase the culture of the Centaur Kingdom to the world and change the international community’s stereotypical impression of centaurs; Scorpan added that he hoped this event could promote cultural exchanges and race reconciliation on the Griffonica continent: centaurs, gargoyles, griffons, ponies, and dragons are all welcome to participate.
For the international community, the significance of this high-profile announcement is greater than the events themselves: the rumors of Scorpan being under house arrest by Tirek have been dispelled, and the journalists who came to participate in the event finally have the opportunity to catch a glimpse of the inside of the Centaur Kingdom. However, most of them still have doubts about the real purpose of this event: Tirek does not seem to be the kind of guy who loves delicate ornaments and movies, so why did he agree to Scorpan’s proposal?

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_26_o0]
Sounds good

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_27]
The Great Exhibition of Jahr Null

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_27_desc]
The Great Exhibition of Jahr Null opens today! As scheduled, the Midnight Castle in Tirek’s realm is now open to the public, and the exhibition will last until October 11th.
The exhibition will mainly showcase the culture and specialties of Tirek’s realm and its affiliated regions: including the culture of the centaurs, gargoyles, griffons, and dragons. Tirek has also announced that some treasures that have never been seen before will be displayed at the exhibition.
Besides, some of the confirmed international exhibits include: the steam engine and its derivatives developed by the Lomax Consortium, the military and mining equipment models from the Quarry Farm, the treasures of the former Storm Empire held by the Veco Group in Krug Town, and the original rainbow apples from Appleloosa held by the Qian Duo Duo Agricultural Products Group.

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_27_o0]
Interesting

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_27_o1]
Forget it

[en.EVENT_TIMELINE_27_TOOLTIP]
Unlock a §Rtimed§! series of decisions: §YThe Great Exhibition of Jahr Null§!, which will close on §ROctober 11th§!.

[zh.EVENT_TIMELINE_1]
新元年

[zh.EVENT_TIMELINE_1_desc]
“自‘新元年’开始，小马利亚将会成为一片秩序、和平与繁荣的土地。”——《女皇和煦、女王邪茧与领主提雷克的伟大联合宣言》
1002年12月24日，暖炉节前夕，三巨头重聚首于坎特洛特，对三年间各自领地的管理情况进行了交流，并针对缓和边境争端、联合打击恐怖组织、保护各方粮食安全、应对气候变化等三方关切的诸多议题交换了意见。会议重申，坚持小马-幻形灵-半人马三族友好不动摇，坚持贯彻落实《坎特洛特协定》精神，共同迈向美好的未来。
值得注意的是，应对气候变化成为此次会晤一个新兴但十分重要的议题：自终末之战后，风之魔持续盘旋于小马利亚上空已经有三年之久，其所导致的全球变冷对各个生物的生产和生活构成严重的挑战。恰逢暖炉节，和煦光流女皇指出：“小马设立的暖炉节源于民间自发，初衷是宣传团结合作的理念，以期对抗风之魔。实践表明，暖炉节并没有起到应有的团结小马、对抗风之魔的作用，反而成为以星光熠熠为首的诸多旧谐律势力借题发挥攻击小马利亚帝国政府合法性的工具。”和煦光流女皇随后提议取消暖炉节，更换为新的节日。邪茧女王对这一提议表示赞同，“幻形灵庆祝暖炉节的习俗源自于战犯暮光闪闪的教唆，是小马对幻形灵的一次文化输出，不符合小马和幻形灵友好、平等相处的现实情况”。提雷克大王则建议新节日为“新元年”，以纪念在三巨头领导下小马利亚迈入一个新的时代；提雷克大王也强调，节日设立的目的，应该以增强团结和强调安全为主基调。和煦光流女皇与邪茧女王表示赞同。

[zh.EVENT_TIMELINE_1_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_TIMELINE_1_o1]
胡扯！

[zh.EVENT_TIMELINE_1_THREAT]
暖炉节的取消

[zh.EVENT_TIMELINE_2]
新元年庆祝活动

[zh.EVENT_TIMELINE_2_desc]
12月25日暖炉节当天，三巨头公开举办了盛大的宴会，宴会后，东道主和煦光流女皇宣读了三巨头共同签署的《伟大联合宣言》（全称《女皇和煦、女王邪茧与领主提雷克的伟大联合宣言》），并宣布以新节日“新元年”取代原有的暖炉节。
为彰显“新元年”的跨时代性和三巨头维护共同安全稳定的决心，三巨头联合举办了针对终末之战遗留战犯的公审活动，公审流程持续超过三个小时，取得以下成果：以暮光闪闪为首的六名小马战犯、以索拉克斯为首的若干幻形灵战犯，被处以钝器死刑；两名小马利亚前公主被宣判无期徒刑，将关押在塔尔塔洛斯监狱；六名长老被宣判无期徒刑，将关押在坎特洛特监狱。
“今天，标志着新元年的起点——新的纪元！今天，我们将彻底抛弃旧世界！历史，在今天终结；未来，从今天开始！”
新元年庆祝活动在热烈的呼声中结束。

[zh.EVENT_TIMELINE_2_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_TIMELINE_2_o1]
安息吧...柔柔...

[zh.EVENT_TIMELINE_2_o2]
安息吧...暮光闪闪导师...

[zh.EVENT_TIMELINE_2_o3]
安息吧...朋友们...

[zh.EVENT_TIMELINE_2_o4]
很好！

[zh.EVENT_TIMELINE_2_o5]
唉...

[zh.EVENT_TIMELINE_2_o6]
